    "sections": {
        "description": "The ST Spa WordPress theme is ideal for wellness centers, spa owners, and health professionals, offering serene, visually appealing websites with fully responsive, retina-ready layouts. It includes numerous customization options such as a service section, banner, testimonials, and social media integration, making it user-friendly for both beginners and experts. Whether promoting spa services, health products, or wellness tips, this theme’s clean, elegant design is perfect for your business. With the Elementor drag-and-drop builder, anyone can create beautiful landing pages, service listings, blogs, and galleries without any coding skills. ST Spa is mobile-friendly and fully responsive, providing an optimal user experience across desktops, tablets, and smartphones, allowing site management and optimization from any device. It also features Google Fonts, Cross Browser Compatibility, Clean Code, and Custom Widgets, ensuring a modern, professional look that enhances your brand, regardless of the wellness service you offer.. ST Spa WP Theme Demo Page: https://striviothemes.com/demo/st-spa-pro/"
    },
